            0.066
          ],
          "content": "Tales by Dots and Lines"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.41,
            0.096,
            0.59,
            0.12
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "SUMMARY"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.141,
            0.824,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": "Last year we looked at mean as a fair-share. Here, we learnt how the sum of the distances of the values to its left and right are the same."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.207,
            0.824,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": "We saw that when values greater than the mean are inserted, the  mean increases. When values less than the mean are inserted, the mean decreases. Similar phenomena can be observed with the median."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.292,
            0.744,
            0.312
          ],
          "content": "y Line graphs can be used to visualise change over time."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.321,
            0.824,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": "We saw that examining data can lead to new questions and directions to probe further."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.87,
